@startuml v2_D6_ReportingEvaluation
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  ArrowColor Black
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}

title D6 - Reporting, Compliance & Evaluation (UC40-UC45)

actor "Club Management Board" as CMB
actor "ICPDP Officer" as ICPDP

rectangle UCMS {
  usecase UC40 as "UC40
  Submit the periodic activity report"
  usecase UC41 as "UC41
  Assess the periodic activity report"
  usecase UC42 as "UC42 [Phase 2]
  Manage violation and compliance cases"
  usecase UC43 as "UC43 [Phase 2]
  Configure the evaluation scheme"
  usecase UC44 as "UC44 [Phase 2]
  Generate the club performance
  evaluation draft"
  usecase UC45 as "UC45 [Phase 2]
  Review, finalize and publish
  the evaluation"
}

CMB -- UC40

ICPDP -- UC41
ICPDP -- UC42
ICPDP -- UC43
ICPDP -- UC44
ICPDP -- UC45

note bottom of UC44
  Consumes UC21, UC32, UC34, UC39, UC41, UC42,
  UC48, UC49, UC50 and UC53. Those are data
  dependencies stated in the specification, not
  use case relationships - a use case diagram
  never shows sequence.
end note

note bottom of UC43
  BR29: a scheme cannot be activated unless the
  total weight is valid. v1 validated a scheme
  that no use case ever configured.
end note
@enduml
